# Snapshots are a scratch baseline for a refactoring session, not a committed
# artifact: the derivation hashes go stale on every `nix flake update`, which
# would churn ~34k lines on each nixpkgs bump.
#
# To instead commit them as a reviewable "what did this PR change" artifact
# (like nixpkgs-review), delete this file and run `just snap`.
tests/snapshots/
